  "description": "After his first idol group failed, Lee Jieon clawed his way through a brutal survival audition show for a second chance at stardom. Failure is not an option. So when his new group’s member, Jeong Tae-Oh, turns out to be a notorious, women-obsessed fuckboy whose endless list of female contacts threatens to spark a career-ending scandal, Ji-Eon is pushed to his absolute limit. Desperate to keep their group safe, Ji-Eon makes an insane, sacrificial offer as the leader: if Tae-Oh is that desperate to satisfy his urges, Ji-Eon will just take care of it himself. \n\nProblem solved, right? Wrong. Because the moment Ji-Eon gets hands-on to manage his unruly member, he stumbles upon Tae-Oh’s ultimate, well-kept secret…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
